        </li>
        <li class="process-list__item" data-reveal>
          <div class="process-list__item-head"><span class="process-list__item-number">03</span><div><p class="process-list__item-label">DIRECTION</p><p class="process-list__item-title">制作ディレクション</p></div></div>
          <p class="process-list__item-desc">デザイナー・コーダーと連携し、<br>制作を進めます。</p>
        </li>
        <li class="process-list__item" data-reveal>
          <div class="process-list__item-head"><span class="process-list__item-number">04</span><div><p class="process-list__item-label">CHECK</p><p class="process-list__item-title">確認・品質管理</p></div></div>
          <p class="process-list__item-desc">デザインや実装を確認し、<br>必要な修正を整理します。</p>
